<h2>International Fairs &amp; Exhibitions</h2><p>First Ethiopian International Crop Producers &amp; Agribusiness Expo 2026</p>

<p> </p>

<p>The Ethiopian Crop Producers and Exporters Multisectoral Association, in collaboration with Nordic Trading, the Ministry of Agriculture, and the Ministry of Industry, is organizing the First Ethiopian International Crop Producers &amp; Agribusiness Expo 2026. The Expo will serve as a major international platform to showcase Ethiopia’s crop production, agro-processing, export potential, agri-technology innovations, and investment opportunities, while facilitating business linkages and trade partnerships.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>The Expo will be held from <strong>5–7 November 2026</strong> at the Addis International Convention Center, Addis Ababa, Ethiopia.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Website: <a href="https://www.ethiocropexpo.com/">https://www.ethiocropexpo.com/</a></p>

