<p>Participate in Sri Lanka Expo 2027</p>

<p><strong>Sri Lanka Expo 2027</strong>, Sri Lanka''s premier international trade exhibition, organized by the <strong>Sri Lanka Export Development Board (EDB)</strong> under the Ministry of Industry and Entrepreneurship Development. The event will be held from <strong>14-17 January 2027</strong> at the <strong>Bandaranaike Memorial International Conference Hall (BMICH), Colombo, Sri Lanka</strong>.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Sri Lanka Expo 2027 is expected to bring together <strong>over 750 exhibitors, more than 2,000 international buyers, investors, trade delegations, chambers of commerce, policymakers, and industry leaders from over 50 countries</strong>, creating a unique platform for trade, investment, sourcing, and business networking opportunities.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>The Expo will showcase Sri Lanka''s strengths across a wide range of sectors, including agriculture, manufacturing, export services, innovation, technology, tourism, and emerging industries. The event will also feature structured <strong>B2B matchmaking sessions, an Investor Forum, industry-specific programs, fashion shows, culinary showcases, and cultural performances</strong>.</p>

<p>We kindly request your support in disseminating this opportunity among your member companies, importers, buyers, distributors, retailers, investors, and business networks who may be interested in exploring partnerships and sourcing opportunities from Sri Lanka.</p>

<p> </p>

<p><strong>Special Benefits for International Buyers and Investors</strong></p>

<p>The attached information package includes details on:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Pre-arranged B2B meetings with Sri Lankan exporters</li>
	<li>Discounted hotel accommodation at partner hotels</li>
	<li>Special airfare discounts offered by SriLankan Airlines</li>
	<li>Airport-to-hotel and venue shuttle services</li>
	<li>Buyer assistance and facilitation services</li>
	<li>Investor-focused opportunities and business networking programs</li>
</ul>

<p>International buyers and investors can benefit from concessionary packages designed to facilitate productive business engagement during the Expo.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>For additional information and registration, please visit: <a href="https://srilankaexpo.lk/"><u>https://srilankaexpo.lk</u></a></p>

<p> </p>

<p>Attached are the following documents for your reference and circulation among interested members:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Sri Lanka Expo 2027 Buyer Brochure</li>
	<li>Hosted Buyer Package</li>
	<li>General Buyer Package</li>
	<li>Accommodation Package</li>
	<li>Investor Facilitation Information</li>
	<li>Discounted Airfare Offers</li>
	<li>Discounted Hotel Rates</li>
</ul>

<p> </p>

<p>Should you require any further information, please do not hesitate to contact us.</p>

<p> </p>

