<p> <strong>Help Pink Ribbon Build Pakistan’s first dedicated Breast Cancer Hospital</strong></p>

<table>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td></td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

<p>Over 10 million women are at risk of Breast Cancer while more than 40,000 women die from this disease every year. Facts reveal that breast cancer is affecting more than 90,000 households every year.</p>

<p>To provide relief to poor people, Pink Ribbon is setting up Pakistan’s 1st dedicated Breast Cancer Hospital where deserving patients will be provided free of cost and complete treatment under one roof.</p>

<p>The COVID-19 pandemic has woken us to the fact that we are in dire need of healthcare facilities, now more than ever.</p>

<p>Pink Ribbon is working day and night to ensure that the Pink Ribbon Hospital is soon functional and has already constructed 12,000 sq. ft. of the hospital building. We need your help to complete the hospital at the earliest. So, Breast Cancer patients don’t have to suffer more. The estimated cost of the project is around Rs.730 million.</p>

<p>Your support to build this hospital can turn a victim into a survivor. Join us in this lifesaving cause and let the women enjoy a happy and healthy life. These are the women we love, admire, respect, and to whom we owe a debt of gratitude.</p>

<p> </p>

